<title>BELGIUM: Bank BBL rates Xeikon buy.</title>
<headline>Bank BBL rates Xeikon buy.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Xeikon	   Reprographics  $10 *     Bank BBL</p>
<p>COMMENT: Xeikon's settlement of its patents dispute with Xerox and its letter of intent to sign a technology licensing agreement with Xerox (to add to those with Agfa-Gevaert, IBM and Nilpeter) does not appear to have been grasped by the market. At 22.7 times estimated 1997 earnings the stock is not cheap, but with a 1998 P/E of 12.7 the stock is clearly undervalued when earnings are expected to grow at an average annual rate of 50 percent in the next five years.</p>
<p>Recommendation: BUY Analyst: Erik Theyssens (*) Date of research report: 27/09/96</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p> 1996	   13 cents   n/a	76.9	 none</p>
<p> 1997	   44 cents   n/a	22.7	 none</p>
<p> 1998	   79 cents   n/a	12.7	 n/a</p>
